    "charts": {
      "_description": "How this system draws data. Axes and legends are named once and pointed at by chart types, the way a component points at a color block — so \"our charts' left axis\" is one subject you edit, not a decision repeated per chart. Data is never a token: the specimens draw fixed sample series so the SYSTEM can be judged, the way the type stack shows a fixed pangram.",
